507
00:32:26,403 --> 00:32:28,447
- Se va.
- Gracias a Dios.

508
00:32:30,782 --> 00:32:32,451
Gracias, cariño.

509
00:32:35,328 --> 00:32:37,200
Aléjate de mi familia.

510
00:32:38,165 --> 00:32:40,500
De acuerdo. Suena bien.

511
00:32:44,171 --> 00:32:46,240
